        "content" : "For p ∈ [0,n], let Xp(X) be the space of all algebraic p-vector ﬁelds on X, and let [, ]Sch be the Schouten bracket on X(X) = ⊕np=0Xp(X). For W ⊂ Zn and p ∈ [0,n], let Xp(X)W be the direct sum of the (C×)n-weight spaces in Xp(X) with weights in W. By deﬁnition Xp(X)W = 0 if W = ∅."
