        "content" : "We remark that the miracle that the Poisson deformations along π1S(c) as in Theorem A are unobstructed has been observed in [MPS20] in the context of complex log-symplectic manifolds. While the methods of [MPS20] heavily used the homotopy algebra techniques, such L∞-algebras, our proofs are elementary and our strategies are adopted from [MPS24] where deformations of q-symmetric algebras are studied."
